OL,3,GNEWSADrugs, violence and racism: A week
OL,4,Ain Glasgow city centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FVideos of brutal beatings, blatant drug
OL,7,Fdeals, and racial violence in the
OL,8,Fcentre of Scotland's biggest city have
OL,9,Fbecome a common sight on social media.
OL,11,FPosts claim that parts of Glasgow's
OL,12,Fcity centre are a "no-go zone" where
OL,13,Fit's not safe for unsuspecting members
OL,14,Fof the public, especially women, to
OL,15,Fenter.
OL,17,FAngry protests have spilled on to the
OL,18,Fstreets - but is it as bad as some say?
OL,20,FFor a week in June, BBC Disclosure
OL,21,Ffilmed in the city centre to see for
OL,22,Fourselves.
OL,23,APub: 17-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
